==Description==
The '''Korblox Undead''' was an enemy that only appeared in [[Huevous Hunt]] as part of [[The Hunt Event]]. It had a very high amount of health, though it was slower than every enemy that appeared before it. Additionally, it was also immune to being set on fire by towers like the [[Pyromancer]]. On some waves in hard mode, it was also a lead enemy, meaning that it could only be damaged by towers with lead detection.

==Appearance==
The '''Korblox Undead''' had blue skin. It did not have a head or a torso, exposing its skeleton. It wore a grey chestplate, shoulder-pads, arm-pads, knee-pads, shoes and pants, and it also had a blue cape. Its skull had blue flames coming out of it.

==Strategy==
*As this enemy has [[Burn Immunity]], the [[Pyromancer]] is much less effective against it, though it can still handle it in easy mode.
**In hard mode, as it spawns in larger hordes and has significantly more health, neither the [[Pyromancer]] or [[Golden Pyromancer]] can kill these on their own. It is recommended to place down another tower to help out, such as the [[Scout]], [[Shotgunner]], [[Minigunner]] or [[Golden Soldier]].
*In hard mode, the '''Korblox Undead''' can spawn as a lead enemy, meaning that only towers with lead detection can damage it.
**Towers like the [[Minigunner]] or [[Accelerator]] are one of the better options against the lead '''Korblox Undead'''.

